    "title": "Lehi couple charged for alleged ongoing sexual abuse of underage daughter - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Amelia Hobson ,\n1 days ago LEHI, Utah (ABC4) — Two people have been charged with multiple first-degree felonies after allegedly sexually abusing their underage daughter for several years. The first of the individuals, an adult male, has been charged with ten counts of aggravated sexual abuse of a child (first-degree felony), two counts of rape (first-degree felony), one count of object rape (first-degree felony), and four counts of forcible sexual abuse (second-degree felony). Read full article",
